      "source": "allocation/get-errno.md YAML api_location lists msvcrt.dll",
      "observation": "Installed mingw-w64 libmsvcrt-os.a provides _get/_set errno/doserrno via static compatibility members rather than direct IAT import objects.",
      "resolution": "Conservative admitted named subset: pointer accessors in both built-ins; validated accessors and invalid-handler names in UCRT only. Full native Windows export inventory unknown."
    }
  ],
  "profiles": [
    "Default new-handler mode only; mode/handler setters and queries are absent exports.",
    "Each runtime owns a distinct private heap and host ledger; invalid/double/cross-runtime blocks fail closed with STATUS_HEAP_CORRUPTION. Native invalid-pointer exact behavior unknown.",
    "_msize reports requested size; _expand uses the shared non-LFH best-fit allocator and keeps a zero-logical-size block for size 0. Native private heap capacity and zero-size _expand geometry unknown.",
    "Zero-operand calloc uses one requested byte; Microsoft specifies a nonzero allocation but not an exact usable size.",
    "Lazy thread error-state establishment failure raises STATUS_NO_MEMORY when no errno cell exists. Ordinary allocator OOM after establishment returns NULL with ENOMEM.",
    "Allocator errno write access is preflighted before mutations. Exact native CRT protection/fault ordering unknown.",
    "FAST_FAIL_INVALID_ARG default terminates with 0xC0000409 without guest SEH/DLL/FLS callbacks; debugger-specific reason/exception parameter observation is not implemented."
  ]
}
